{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Interactive Shade Selector & Tone Matching Guide (Bespoke for P02 Fibers & P04 Compact)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-shade-guide-section" style="padding: 72px 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">SHADE MATCHING SPECIALIST</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Find Your Perfect Color Match</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        Formulated with micro-milled cosmetic mineral pigments designed to blend seamlessly into your natural root tone with zero visible demarcation line.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
      <!-- Shade 01 -->
      <div style="background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1A1A1A; margin: 0 auto 16px; border: 3px solid #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">SHADE 01</div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 8px;">Natural Black</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Best for jet black, soft black, and deep espresso hair tones. Blends seamlessly without a bluish or grayish undertone.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #7A6671; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; display: inline-block;">
          Root Match: Level 1–2
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Shade 02 -->
      <div style="background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #382218; margin: 0 auto 16px; border: 3px solid #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">SHADE 02</div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 8px;">Dark Brown</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Our most popular shade. Engineered for rich chocolate, coffee, and dark brunette hair. Natural warm neutral base.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #7A6671; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; display: inline-block;">
          Root Match: Level 3–4
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Shade 03 -->
      <div style="background: #FAF7F2; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5C3826; margin: 0 auto 16px; border: 3px solid #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);"></div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">SHADE 03</div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 8px;">Medium Brown</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Engineered for chestnut, caramel, light brown, or highlighted brunette hair. Provides soft-focus dimensional depth.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #7A6671; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; display: inline-block;">
          Root Match: Level 5–6
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tone Matching Advice Tip -->
    <div style="margin-top: 36px; background: #FDF2F6; border: 1px solid #F0D3DE; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 24px; text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.5;">
        💡 <strong>Pro Colorist Tip:</strong> When matching sparse roots or gray regrowth, always match your <em>root base color</em> rather than highlighted ends. If you fall between two shades, start with the lighter tone and layer the darker tone lightly over top.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC Shade Guide",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
